    "formulaDescription": "A rule-based checklist: baseline entry, clothing, fuel and logistics sections are always included; trail adds navigation and emergency items; hot, cold and rain add weather-specific items; over-6h adds long-race items; travel adds travel items. No prediction or scoring is produced.",
    "assumptions": [
      "The checklist is general preparation support, not a race's mandatory kit list.",
      "Organiser rules, route briefing and medical advice take precedence.",
      "A checked item means remembered, not tested or guaranteed.",
      "The tool does not store or upload personal data."
    ],
    "rounding": "No numerical rounding; the output is a structured checklist.",
